          "text": "Start with a practical technical book such as The Pragmatic Programmer"
        },
        {
          "@type": "HowToStep",
          "position": 2,
          "text": "Add The 12 Week Year to plan your reading and your work"
        },
        {
          "@type": "HowToStep",
          "position": 3,
          "text": "Read Freedom from the Known to question your habits"
        },
        {
          "@type": "HowToStep",
          "position": 4,
          "text": "Move on to a deeper technical book like Designing Data-Intensive Applications"
        },
        {
